 "stimulus_html": "<p>Use the following to answer questions 6 – 8.</p>\n<p>Copies of a book are arranged in a stack. Each copy of a book is 2.1 cm thick.</p>\n<table class=\"os-raise-wideequaltable unnumbered\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Row</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Copies of book</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Stack height in cm</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>a</td>\n      <td>0</td>\n      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>b</td>\n      <td>1</td>\n      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>c</td>\n      <td>2</td>\n      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>d</td>\n      <td>3</td>\n      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>e</td>\n      <td>4</td>\n      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>",
